                                "sense_id": "da5fbf5e-fb03-35e4-9dd0-8f3f15aa0f2e",
                                "text": "In order to achieve this aim, however, it is imperative to have an omnibearing industrial policy integrating different policies for different trades with different policies of the central and local authorities and of different regions."
